{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrogen-colors-and-green-hydrogen","title":"氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations/hydrogen-colors-and-green-hydrogen","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义\">氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义</h1><p>当一个投资人问&quot;这个项目用的是绿氢吗&quot;，背后隐含着一套完整的分类体系——按生产路径和碳排放强度，氢被赋予了不同的&quot;颜色&quot;标签。这套色谱不仅是行业术语，更是监管框架、碳关税计算和绿色融资认证的底层逻辑。理解色谱的精确边界，是判断一个氢能项目是否符合政策补贴条件、是否能通过 CBAM 认证的第一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>氢本身是无色气体，&quot;颜色&quot;标签来自其生产过程的碳足迹差异。全球主流分类体系将氢能分为以下类别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>颜色标签</th>\n<th>生产路径</th>\n<th>原料</th>\n<th>碳排放强度</th>\n<th>2026 年成本区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灰氢</td>\n<td>天然气蒸汽甲烷重整（SMR）</td>\n<td>天然气</td>\n<td>9-12 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>$1.15-3.31/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝氢</td>\n<td>SMR + 碳捕集与封存（CCS）</td>\n<td>天然气</td>\n<td>1-4 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>$1.80-3.50/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿氢</td>\n<td>可再生能源电解水</td>\n<td>水 + 绿电</td>\n<td>0-0.5 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>$2.50-5.00/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粉氢</td>\n<td>核电电解水</td>\n<td>水 + 核电</td>\n<td>~0.5 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>$3.00-5.50/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿松石氢</td>\n<td>甲烷热解</td>\n<td>天然气</td>\n<td>固态碳（不排放）</td>\n<td>$2.00-4.00/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白氢</td>\n<td>地质天然氢开采</td>\n<td>地壳</td>\n<td>~0</td>\n<td>探索阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>灰氢目前占全球氢气产量的 96% 以上。2026 年灰氢成本出现显著的区域分化：美国 Henry Hub 气价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext>对应灰氢成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.12/MMBtu 对应灰氢成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.12/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对应灰氢成本</span></span></span></span></span>1.15-1.30/kg，而欧洲 TTF 气价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext>叠加</mtext><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>S</mi><mtext>碳价€</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>吨</mtext><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>，将灰氢成本推高至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16.5/MMBtu 叠加 EU ETS 碳价 €80/吨 CO₂，将灰氢成本推高至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.5/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">叠加</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碳价</span><span class=\"mord\">€80/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">吨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，将灰氢成本推高至</span></span></span></span></span>3.18-3.31/kg。这种区域价差意味着绿氢竞争力阈值在不同司法管辖区相差 300%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"绿色氢能的精确定义与认证标准\">绿色氢能的精确定义与认证标准</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[氢气生产] --&gt; B{电力来源?}&#10;    B --&gt;|可再生能源| C{满足额外性?}&#10;    B --&gt;|电网混合电力| D[非绿氢]&#10;    B --&gt;|核电| E[粉氢/低碳氢]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| F{满足时间相关性?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D&#10;    F --&gt;|月度匹配| G[过渡期绿氢]&#10;    F --&gt;|小时级匹配| H{满足地理相关性?}&#10;    H --&gt;|同一竞价区| I[完全合规绿氢]&#10;    H --&gt;|跨区| J[需额外证明]&#10;    G --&gt; K[2026-2032 过渡期认可]&#10;    I --&gt; L[获得RFNBO认证]\">flowchart TD\n    A[氢气生产] --&gt; B{电力来源?}\n    B --&gt;|可再生能源| C{满足额外性?}\n    B --&gt;|电网混合电力| D[非绿氢]\n    B --&gt;|核电| E[粉氢/低碳氢]\n    C --&gt;|是| F{满足时间相关性?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D\n    F --&gt;|月度匹配| G[过渡期绿氢]\n    F --&gt;|小时级匹配| H{满足地理相关性?}\n    H --&gt;|同一竞价区| I[完全合规绿氢]\n    H --&gt;|跨区| J[需额外证明]\n    G --&gt; K[2026-2032 过渡期认可]\n    I --&gt; L[获得RFNBO认证]</pre><p>&quot;绿色氢能&quot;的定义远非&quot;用可再生能源电解水&quot;这么简单。欧盟 2023 年 6 月通过的 RFNBO（可再生燃料非生物来源）委托法案建立了三重认证门槛：</p>\n<p><strong>额外性（Additionality）</strong>：电解槽使用的可再生能源必须来自新建产能（投运时间不超过电解槽 36 个月前），确保制氢不会挤占现有绿电供给。2026 年 6 月欧委会提前修订 RFNBO 规则，将额外性宽限期从 2038 年延长至 2040 年，新建项目的免除窗口预计推迟至 2032-2033 年。</p>\n<p><strong>时间相关性（Temporal Correlation）</strong>：电解制氢的用电时间必须与可再生能源发电时间匹配。原定 2030 年起要求小时级匹配，修订后预计推迟至 2032-2033 年实施，此前允许月度匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>地理相关性（Geographic Correlation）</strong>：电解槽与可再生能源电站必须位于同一电力竞价区（bidding zone），或通过直连线路供电。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灰氢与绿氢的碳排放全生命周期比较\">灰氢与绿氢的碳排放全生命周期比较</h2><p>全生命周期分析（LCA）是判断氢能&quot;绿色程度&quot;的科学基础。欧盟要求绿氢的温室气体减排量必须达到化石燃料基准的 70% 以上。计算公式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GHG_{savings} = \\frac{GHG_{fossil} - GHG_{H_2}}{GHG_{fossil}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中化石燃料基准为 94 g <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>eq/MJ（对应约 11.2 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。要达到 70% 减排门槛，绿氢的全链碳排放不得超过 3.36 kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/kg <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>实际计算中需要纳入的排放源包括：电解过程用电的碳足迹（取决于电源碳强度）、电解槽制造的隐含碳、水处理与纯化的能耗、氢气压缩/液化的能耗。当使用专用可再生能源直供时，电力碳足迹接近零；当使用电网余电时，需按该时段电网的边际碳强度计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蓝氢的争议与绿氢的相对优势\">蓝氢的争议与绿氢的相对优势</h2><p>蓝氢曾被视为从灰氢向绿氢过渡的&quot;桥梁方案&quot;——保留天然气 SMR 工艺，在末端加装 CCS 装置。然而 2026 年的产业实践暴露了几个关键问题：</p>\n<p>CCS 捕集率的现实差距：设计值通常为 90-95%，但实际运行项目（如 Shell Quest、Boundary Dam）的长期平均捕集率仅 60-80%。加上甲烷泄漏（天然气开采、运输环节的逃逸排放率约 1-3%），蓝氢的实际碳减排效果大打折扣。</p>\n<p>成本锁定风险：蓝氢项目锁定对天然气的长期依赖——当气价上涨（如欧洲 TTF 从 2020 年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext>飙升至</mtext><mn>2022</mn><mtext>年峰值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5/MMBtu 飙升至 2022 年峰值</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">飙升至</span><span class=\"mord\">2022</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年峰值</span></span></span></span></span>70/MMBtu），蓝氢成本随之暴涨，而绿氢成本持续下降。</p>\n<p>资产搁浅风险：随着绿氢成本逼近甚至低于蓝氢，投入数十亿美元的 CCS 基础设施可能在项目生命周期中段失去经济性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年全球绿氢定义标准的区域差异\">2026 年全球绿氢定义标准的区域差异</h2><p>不同监管区域对&quot;绿色氢能&quot;的定义存在实质性差异，这对跨境贸易和项目融资产生直接影响：</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟</strong>：最严格的三重门槛（额外性 + 时间相关性 + 地理相关性），2025 年 7 月新增低碳氢方法论（70% 减排门槛），2026 年 Q3 将发布修订版氢能战略与 RED IV 提案。</p>\n<p><strong>美国 IRA 45V</strong>：按碳强度分四档补贴——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>（</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>）到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.60/kg（4-2.5 kg CO₂/kg H₂）到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）到</span></span></span></span></span>3.00/kg（&lt;0.45 kg CO₂/kg H₂），额外性和时间匹配要求相对宽松。</p>\n<p><strong>中国</strong>：2026 年三部委试点通知未设置严格的额外性要求，主要通过&quot;风光氢耦合&quot;项目模式确保绿电直供，重点关注终端价格目标（25 元/kg 以下）而非过程认证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>氢能色谱本质上是碳排放强度的分类工具，&quot;颜色&quot;不代表物理属性而代表生产路径的碳足迹</li>\n<li>绿氢定义在全球尚未统一，欧盟 RFNBO 标准最严格（三重门槛），美国侧重碳强度分级补贴，中国侧重终端价格与场景应用</li>\n<li>灰氢成本的区域分化（美国 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.15</mn><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>欧洲</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.15 vs 欧洲</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">欧洲</span></span></span></span></span>3.31）导致绿氢竞争力窗口因地而异</li>\n<li>蓝氢的&quot;桥梁&quot;定位受到 CCS 实际捕集率不达标和长期气价风险的双重挑战</li>\n<li>理解色谱分类是评估项目合规性、计算碳关税影响、申请绿色融资认证的前提条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"water-electrolysis-principles\">水电解制氢原理</a>——深入理解绿氢生产的物理化学基础</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../environmental-climate-economics/policy-instruments-markets/carbon-pricing-tax-vs-ets\">碳定价：碳税与排放交易</a>——理解碳价如何影响灰氢成本与绿氢竞争力窗口</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义","id":"氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"绿色氢能的精确定义与认证标准","id":"绿色氢能的精确定义与认证标准"},{"level":2,"text":"灰氢与绿氢的碳排放全生命周期比较","id":"灰氢与绿氢的碳排放全生命周期比较"},{"level":2,"text":"蓝氢的争议与绿氢的相对优势","id":"蓝氢的争议与绿氢的相对优势"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年全球绿氢定义标准的区域差异","id":"2026-年全球绿氢定义标准的区域差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"水电解制氢原理与能效边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations/water-electrolysis-principles"}}